# [[fair]], [[blond]]
#: ''Ég hef '''ljóst''' hár.''
#:: I have '''blond''' hair.
#: ''Drengurinn var brúnhærður, ljós yfirlitum og feiminn.''
#:: The boy had brown hair and shy with a '''fair''' complexion.

